    "message": "Brooklyn's longest run of month-over-month growth in pre-tax sales was 6 months, from October 2023 through March 2024, rising each month from $54,488 to $106,350. I used pre-tax sales (subtotal divided by 100). The other runs were shorter: 2 months (Jul–Aug 2023) and 4 months twice (Oct 2024–Jan 2025 and Oct 2025–Jan 2026). June 2023 has no earlier month inside the June 2023–September 2026 window, so it can't count as growth; counting it against May wouldn't change the answer. All months in the window are complete, since the current month, November 2026, falls outside it."
